{"id":"4c85902878b27217","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-natural-property.md","title":"自然性质的三个条件","display":"df-natural-property — 自然性质的三个条件","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-natural-property","aliases":["28-df-natural-property"],"display":"df-natural-property — 自然性质的三个条件","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","[[28-df-circuit-size]]","[[28-df-circuit-computes-function]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]","[[28-df-tm]]"],"source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_printed_pages":"499","source_pdf_pages":"525"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-natural-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-natural-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-natural-property — 自然性质的三个条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0761cc6d55d40d5e\" href=\"?note=0761cc6d55d40d5e\" title=\"28-df-circuit-computes-function\">28-df-circuit-computes-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"499"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"525"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a> 的机器集。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_n=\\{f\\mid f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal B_n=\\{f\\mid f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tt}_n(f)\\in\\{0,1\\}^{2^n}\">\\(\\operatorname{tt}_n(f)\\in\\{0,1\\}^{2^n}\\)</span> 按字典序列出真值表。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=(P_n)_{n\\ge1}\">\\(P=(P_n)_{n\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_n:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(P_n:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(s:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(b\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为规模阈值。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BF}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{BF}(C)\\)</span> 为有界扇入谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{size}(C)\\)</span> 为非输入门数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}_C(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{out}_C(x)\\)</span> 为输出向量，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7776a98a623ada8d\" href=\"?note=7776a98a623ada8d\" title=\"28-df-boolean-circuit\">28-df-boolean-circuit</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"14f69cc09dc02600\" href=\"?note=14f69cc09dc02600\" title=\"28-df-circuit-size\">28-df-circuit-size</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0761cc6d55d40d5e\" href=\"?note=0761cc6d55d40d5e\" title=\"28-df-circuit-computes-function\">28-df-circuit-computes-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(w)\">\\(M(w)\\)</span> 与时间来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>；判定输出是单比特串。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tt}_n:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\{0,1\\}^{2^n},\\qquad\\operatorname{tt}_n(f)_{1+\\sum_{i=1}^nx_i2^{n-i}}\\coloneqq f(x)\\quad(f\\in\\mathcal B_n,\\ x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tt}_n:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\{0,1\\}^{2^n},\\qquad\\operatorname{tt}_n(f)_{1+\\sum_{i=1}^nx_i2^{n-i}}\\coloneqq f(x)\\quad(f\\in\\mathcal B_n,\\ x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_n(b)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathcal B_n\\mid\\exists C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\;(\\operatorname{BF}(C)\\land\\operatorname{size}(C)\\le b\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\operatorname{out}_C(x)=\\langle f(x)\\rangle)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_n(b)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathcal B_n\\mid\\exists C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\;(\\operatorname{BF}(C)\\land\\operatorname{size}(C)\\le b\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\operatorname{out}_C(x)=\\langle f(x)\\rangle)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Useful}(P,s)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\ge n_0\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal S_n(s(n))\\;P_n(f)=0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Constructive}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal B_n\\;(M(\\operatorname{tt}_n(f))=\\langle P_n(f)\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{time}_M(\\operatorname{tt}_n(f))\\le c\\,2^{dn}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Large}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\ge n_0\\;\\frac{|\\{f\\in\\mathcal B_n\\mid P_n(f)=1\\}|}{2^{2^n}}\\ge\\frac1n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Natural}(P,s)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{Useful}(P,s)\\land\\operatorname{Constructive}(P)\\land\\operatorname{Large}(P).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Useful}(P,s)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\ge n_0\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal S_n(s(n))\\;P_n(f)=0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Constructive}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal B_n\\;(M(\\operatorname{tt}_n(f))=\\langle P_n(f)\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{time}_M(\\operatorname{tt}_n(f))\\le c\\,2^{dn}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Large}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\ge n_0\\;\\frac{|\\{f\\in\\mathcal B_n\\mid P_n(f)=1\\}|}{2^{2^n}}\\ge\\frac1n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Natural}(P,s)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{Useful}(P,s)\\land\\operatorname{Constructive}(P)\\land\\operatorname{Large}(P).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>严格采用此 PDF 的 largeness 下界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/n\">\\(1/n\\)</span>，没有擅换为其他文献常见的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-O(n)}\">\\(2^{-O(n)}\\)</span>。Constructive 是真值表长度的多项式时间；相对于变量数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 则是指数时间。Useful 和 Large 采用最终成立的序列版本，剔除有限小规模例外。此处阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 按本目录的非输入门数计；原书精确总顶点阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 对应条件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+\\operatorname{size}(C)\\le b\">\\(n+\\operatorname{size}(C)\\le b\\)</span>，使用原书的定量阈值时须作这一换算。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§23.1，印刷 p.499 / PDF p.525。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-computes-function","status":"resolved","id":"0761cc6d55d40d5e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-computes-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 是 [[28-df-tm]] 的机器集。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"7776a98a623ada8d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B_n=\\{f\\mid f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。$\\operatorname{tt}_n(f)\\in\\{0,1\\}^{2^n}$ 按字典序列出真值表。$P=(P_n)_{n\\ge1}$，$P_n:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\{0,1\\}$。$s:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N$；$b\\in\\mathbb N$ 为规模阈值。\n$\\operatorname{BF}(C)$ 为有界扇入谓词，$\\operatorname{size}(C)$ 为非输入门数，$\\operatorname{out}_C(x)$ 为输出向量，see [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]、[[28-df-circuit-size]]、[[28-df-circuit-computes-function]]。$M(w)$ 与时间来自 [[28-df-machine-resources]]；判定输出是单比特串。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-size","status":"resolved","id":"14f69cc09dc02600","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B_n=\\{f\\mid f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。$\\operatorname{tt}_n(f)\\in\\{0,1\\}^{2^n}$ 按字典序列出真值表。$P=(P_n)_{n\\ge1}$，$P_n:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\{0,1\\}$。$s:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N$；$b\\in\\mathbb N$ 为规模阈值。\n$\\operatorname{BF}(C)$ 为有界扇入谓词，$\\operatorname{size}(C)$ 为非输入门数，$\\operatorname{out}_C(x)$ 为输出向量，see [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]、[[28-df-circuit-size]]、[[28-df-circuit-computes-function]]。$M(w)$ 与时间来自 [[28-df-machine-resources]]；判定输出是单比特串。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-computes-function","status":"resolved","id":"0761cc6d55d40d5e","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B_n=\\{f\\mid f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。$\\operatorname{tt}_n(f)\\in\\{0,1\\}^{2^n}$ 按字典序列出真值表。$P=(P_n)_{n\\ge1}$，$P_n:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\{0,1\\}$。$s:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N$；$b\\in\\mathbb N$ 为规模阈值。\n$\\operatorname{BF}(C)$ 为有界扇入谓词，$\\operatorname{size}(C)$ 为非输入门数，$\\operatorname{out}_C(x)$ 为输出向量，see [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]、[[28-df-circuit-size]]、[[28-df-circuit-computes-function]]。$M(w)$ 与时间来自 [[28-df-machine-resources]]；判定输出是单比特串。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B_n=\\{f\\mid f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。$\\operatorname{tt}_n(f)\\in\\{0,1\\}^{2^n}$ 按字典序列出真值表。$P=(P_n)_{n\\ge1}$，$P_n:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\{0,1\\}$。$s:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N$；$b\\in\\mathbb N$ 为规模阈值。\n$\\operatorname{BF}(C)$ 为有界扇入谓词，$\\operatorname{size}(C)$ 为非输入门数，$\\operatorname{out}_C(x)$ 为输出向量，see [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]、[[28-df-circuit-size]]、[[28-df-circuit-computes-function]]。$M(w)$ 与时间来自 [[28-df-machine-resources]]；判定输出是单比特串。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_n=\\{f\\mid f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tt}_n(f)\\in\\{0,1\\}^{2^n}","display":false},{"tex":"P=(P_n)_{n\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"P_n:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"s:\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BF}(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{out}_C(x)","display":false},{"tex":"M(w)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tt}_n:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\{0,1\\}^{2^n},\\qquad\\operatorname{tt}_n(f)_{1+\\sum_{i=1}^nx_i2^{n-i}}\\coloneqq f(x)\\quad(f\\in\\mathcal B_n,\\ x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal S_n(b)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathcal B_n\\mid\\exists C\\in\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1}\\;(\\operatorname{BF}(C)\\land\\operatorname{size}(C)\\le b\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\operatorname{out}_C(x)=\\langle f(x)\\rangle)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Useful}(P,s)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\ge n_0\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal S_n(s(n))\\;P_n(f)=0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Constructive}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal B_n\\;(M(\\operatorname{tt}_n(f))=\\langle P_n(f)\\rangle\\land\\operatorname{time}_M(\\operatorname{tt}_n(f))\\le c\\,2^{dn}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Large}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\exists n_0\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall n\\ge n_0\\;\\frac{|\\{f\\in\\mathcal B_n\\mid P_n(f)=1\\}|}{2^{2^n}}\\ge\\frac1n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Natural}(P,s)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\operatorname{Useful}(P,s)\\land\\operatorname{Constructive}(P)\\land\\operatorname{Large}(P).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"1/n","display":false},{"tex":"2^{-O(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"n+\\operatorname{size}(C)\\le b","display":false}],"bytes":2972,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-230","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第23章：自然证明障碍：[[28-df-natural-property]]、[[28-thm-natural-property-prf-obstruction]]。"},{"id":"5977d540cf66c60d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P,s,\\mathcal B_n,\\operatorname{Natural}$ 来自 [[28-df-natural-property]]，假设 $\\operatorname{Natural}(P,s)$。\n$K_n\\ne\\varnothing$ 为有限密钥集，$F_n:K_n\\to\\mathcal B_n$；对所有充分大 $n$ 及所有 $k\\in K_n$，$F_n(k)$ 有至多 $s(n)$ 门的有界扇入电路。\n$U_n$ 为 $\\mathcal B_n$ 上均匀随机函数；密钥 $k$ 在 $K_n$ 上独立均匀选取，所有概率使用这些明确的有限均匀分布。"}],"outgoing":["7776a98a623ada8d","14f69cc09dc02600","0761cc6d55d40d5e","b5d4fc2d291ce98b","1965e2b0765554c9"]}